m, restrained amber highlights, subtle paper texture and cast shadows. Each ticket is a single rectangular paper object, no extra detached stubs. Make the tickets large enough to recognize at a small menu-card size. No hand holding them, no money, coins, credit cards, trophy, or extra objects.\n\nKeep every circuit and ticket fully inside the square frame with a modest safe margin. Strong readable hierarchy and cohesive polished game key art; no thin comic panel borders, no unnecessary decoration or large empty areas. Background is a dark muted navy atmosphere that unifies the three landscape islands and gives the ivory tickets contrast. Exactly THREE independent track loops + exactly THREE tickets, with all SIX subjects readable in the central 90% of the artwork. No lettering, titles, numbers, logos, manufacturer branding, watermark, interface or caption; game UI adds its own 3\u00d73 caption separately. Opaque background.",
